      "text": "right, here's what I'm thinking this is probably poorly controlled high blood pressure i'm sending you for a home blood pressure diary because of hypertension let's book blood tests to look into hypertension i'm going to put you on amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day, long term you take it by mouth that should help with high blood pressure check your blood pressure at home twice a day for a week and bring the readings"
